{"id":"7db88256-9748-44de-b67b-3f1b4269e5cc","createdAt":"2026-10-26T15:28:30.448Z","batchId":"settings_glm-5-3-flash-opencode-go_high","approach":"html","modelId":"glm-5.3-flash-opencode-go","settings":{"effort":"high"},"presetId":"settings","prompt":"An account settings panel with profile, notifications and privacy sections.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"```html\n<style>\n  .tabs{display:flex;gap:2px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(128,128,128,.25);margin-bottom:24px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .tab{background:none;border:none;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;padding:10px 18px;cursor:pointer;font:inherit;font-weight:500;opacity:.65;color:inherit}\n  .tab:hover{opacity:1}\n  .tab.active{opacity:1;border-bottom-color:currentColor}\n  .tab .badge{margin-left:8px}\n  .switch{appearance:none;width:38px;height:22px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(128,128,128,.35);position:relative;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s;flex:none}\n  .switch::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;top:2px;left:2px;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;transition:transform .15s}\n  .switch:checked{background:#16a34a}\n  .switch:checked::after{transform:translateX(16px)}\n  .switch:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}\n  .set-row{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;padding:14px 0}\n  .set-row + .set-row{border-top:1px solid rgba(128,128,128,.18)}\n  .set-row h4{margin:0 0 2px}\n  .set-row p{margin:0}\n  .savebar{position:sticky;bottom:0;display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:12px 0}\n  #toast{position:fixed;bottom:24px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:#16a34a;color:#fff;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:500;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .2s;z-index:50}\n  #toast.show{opacity:1}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n      <div class=\"row between center\">\n        <h1 class=\"h1\" style=\"margin:0\">Account settings</h1>\n        <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Pro plan · Member since March 2021</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"lead\">Manage your profile, choose how we contact you, and control who can see your information.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tabs\" role=\"tablist\">\n      <button class=\"tab active\" data-panel=\"profile\" role=\"tab\">Profile</button>\n      <button class=\"tab\" data-panel=\"notifications\" role=\"tab\">Notifications</button>\n      <button class=\"tab\" data-panel=\"privacy\" role=\"tab\">Privacy &amp; security</button>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- ==================== PROFILE ==================== -->\n    <section id=\"panel-profile\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n\n        <div class=\"card stack gap-lg\">\n          <div>\n            <h3 class=\"card-title\">Photo &amp; identity</h3>\n            <p class=\"card-desc\">This is how teammates and collaborators see you across the workspace.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"row gap-lg center\">\n            <div class=\"avatar\" style=\"width:72px;height:72px;font-size:24px\">AR</div>\n            <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n              <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n                <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\">Upload new photo</button>\n                <button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\">Remove</button>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"small muted\">PNG or JPG, at least 256×256px. Max file size 2 MB.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card stack gap-lg\">\n          <div>\n            <h3 class=\"card-title\">Personal information</h3>\n            <p class=\"card-desc\">Used for your public profile, invoices and account recovery.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"grid cols-2 gap-lg\">\n            <label>First name<input type=\"text\" value=\"Amelia\"></label>\n            <label>Last name<input type=\"text\" value=\"Ross\"></label>\n            <label>Username<input type=\"text\" value=\"amelia.ross\"><span class=\"small muted\">northwind.io/@amelia.ross</span></label>\n            <label>Email address<input type=\"email\" value=\"amelia.ross@northwind.io\"><span class=\"row gap-sm center small\" style=\"color:#16a34a\">✓ Verified 12 Aug 2026</span></label>\n            <label>Phone number<input type=\"tel\" value=\"+49 151 2345 6789\"></label>\n            <label>Job title<input type=\"text\" value=\"Senior Product Designer\"></label>\n            <label>Timezone\n              <select><option selected>(GMT+01:00) Berlin — Central European Time</option><option>(GMT+00:00) London</option><option>(GMT-05:00) New York</option><option>(GMT+09:00) Tokyo</option></select>\n            </label>\n            <label>Language\n              <select><option selected>English (UK)</option><option>English (US)</option><option>Deutsch</option><option>Français</option></select>\n            </label>\n          </div>\n          <label>Short bio<textarea rows=\"3\">Design systems, accessibility and the occasional front-end experiment. Currently leading design for the analytics suite.</textarea><span class=\"small muted\">Shown on your public profile. 168 / 280 characters.</span></label>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"savebar\">\n          <span class=\"small muted\" id=\"profile-hint\">Changes are saved to your account automatically for other devices.</span>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\">Discard</button>\n          <button class=\"btn\" id=\"save-profile\">Save changes</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ==================== NOTIFICATIONS ==================== -->\n    <section id=\"panel-notifications\" role=\"tabpanel\" hidden>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n\n        <div class=\"alert\">Email notifications are sent to <strong>amelia.ross@northwind.io</strong>. Push notifications go to 2 registered devices.</div>\n\n        <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n          <div>\n            <h3 class=\"card-title\">Notification channels</h3>\n            <p class=\"card-desc\">Pick where each type of notification is delivered. Security alerts are always on and can’t be disabled.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"set-row\">\n            <div><h4>Mentions &amp; replies</h4><p class=\"small muted\">When someone @mentions you or replies to your comment.</p></div>\n            <div class=\"row gap-sm center\">\n              <label class=\"check small\">Email <input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"switch\" checked></label>\n              <label class=\"check small\">Push <input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"switch\" checked></label>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"set-row\">\n            <div><h4>Task assignments</h4><p class=\"small muted\">When a task is assigned to you or its due date changes.</p></div>\n            <div class=\"row gap-sm center\">\n              <label class=\"check small\">Email <input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"switch\" checked></label>\n              <label class=\"check small\">Push <input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"switch\"></label>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"set-row\">\n            <div><h4>Product updates</h4><p class=\"small muted\">New features, releases and improvements to the workspace.</p></div>\n            <div class=\"row gap-sm center\">\n              <label class=\"check small\">Email <input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"switch\" checked></label>\n              <label class=\"check small\">Push <input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"switch\"></label>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"set-row\">\n            <div><h4>Security alerts</h4><p class=\"small muted\">New sign-ins, password changes and suspicious activity. <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Always on</span></p></div>\n            <div class=\"row gap-sm center\">\n              <label class=\"check small\">Email <input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"switch\" checked disabled></label>\n              <label class=\"check small\">Push <input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"switch\" checked disabled></label>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"set-row\">\n            <div><h4>Marketing &amp; offers</h4><p class=\"small muted\">Occasional emails about promotions and partner deals.</p></div>\n            <div class=\"row gap-sm center\">\n              <label class=\"check small\">Email <input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"switch\"></label>\n              <label class=\"check small\">Push <input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"switch\" disabled></label>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card stack gap-lg\">\n          <div>\n            <h3 class=\"card-title\">Weekly digest &amp; quiet hours</h3>\n            <p class=\"card-desc\">Bundle low-priority activity into a single email and mute push notifications overnight.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"set-row\" style=\"border-top:none;padding-top:0\">\n            <div><h4>Weekly digest</h4><p class=\"small muted\">A Monday summary of unread activity across your projects.</p></div>\n            <div class=\"row gap-sm center\">\n              <label>Day<select><option selected>Monday</option><option>Friday</option></select></label>\n              <label>Time<select><option selected>09:00</option><option>17:00</option></select></label>\n              <label class=\"check small\">On <input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"switch\" checked></label>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"set-row\">\n            <div><h4>Quiet hours</h4><p class=\"small muted\">Push notifications are held and delivered the next morning. Times shown in Berlin (GMT+01:00).</p></div>\n            <div class=\"row gap-sm center\">\n              <label>From<select><option selected>22:00</option><option>21:00</option><option>23:00</option></select></label>\n              <label>To<select><option selected>07:00</option><option>06:00</option><option>08:00</option></select></label>\n              <label class=\"check small\">On <input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"switch\" checked></label>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"savebar\">\n          <span class=\"small muted\">Notification preferences apply instantly.</span>\n          <button class=\"btn save-now\">Save preferences</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ==================== PRIVACY ==================== -->\n    <section id=\"panel-privacy\" role=\"tabpanel\" hidden>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n\n        <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n          <div>\n            <h3 class=\"card-title\">Profile visibility</h3>\n            <p class=\"card-desc\">Control who can view your profile, bio and activity feed.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stack gap-sm\" style=\"padding:0 0 14px\">\n            <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"vis\"> <strong>Public</strong> — anyone with a link can view your profile<span class=\"small muted\" style=\"display:block;margin-left:26px\">Your name, role and bio are visible to signed-out visitors.</span></label>\n            <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"vis\" checked> <strong>Team only</strong> — members of your workspace<span class=\"small muted\" style=\"display:block;margin-left:26px\">Recommended. Guests can see your name and avatar only.</span></label>\n            <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"vis\"> <strong>Private</strong> — only you<span class=\"small muted\" style=\"display:block;margin-left:26px\">Your profile is hidden from search and mentions still work.</span></label>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"set-row\">\n            <div><h4>Search engine indexing</h4><p class=\"small muted\">Allow search engines to index your public profile page.</p></div>\n            <label class=\"check small\">Off <input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"switch\"></label>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n          <div>\n            <h3 class=\"card-title\">Sign-in &amp; security</h3>\n            <p class=\"card-desc\">Keep your account protected with strong authentication.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"set-row\">\n            <div><h4>Two-factor authentication <span class=\"badge\" style=\"background:#16a34a;color:#fff\">Enabled</span></h4><p class=\"small muted\">Authenticator app · Last used 24 Oct 2026, 09:12</p></div>\n            <button class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\">Manage</button>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"set-row\">\n            <div><h4>Password</h4><p class=\"small muted\">Last changed 14 Aug 2026 · Strong</p></div>\n            <button class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\">Change password</button>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"set-row\">\n            <div><h4>Login alerts</h4><p class=\"small muted\">Email me when a new device signs in to my account.</p></div>\n            <label class=\"check small\">On <input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"switch\" checked></label>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n          <div>\n            <h3 class=\"card-title\">Active sessions</h3>\n            <p class=\"card-desc\">Devices currently signed in to your account. Revoking a session signs it out immediately.</p>\n          </div>\n          <table class=\"table\">\n            <thead><tr><th>Device</th><th>Location</th><th>Last active</th><th></th></tr></thead>\n            <tbody>\n              <tr><td>MacBook Pro · Safari <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">This device</span></td><td>Berlin, Germany</td><td class=\"num\">Active now</td><td style=\"text-align:right\"><button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" disabled>Revoke</button></td></tr>\n              <tr><td>iPhone 15 · Northwind app</td><td>Berlin, Germany</td><td class=\"num\">2 hours ago</td><td style=\"text-align:right\"><button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm revoke\">Revoke</button></td></tr>\n              <tr><td>Windows 11 · Chrome</td><td>Amsterdam, Netherlands</td><td class=\"num\">5 days ago</td><td style=\"text-align:right\"><button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm revoke\">Revoke</button></td></tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n          <div style=\"padding-bottom:14px\"><button class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\" id=\"revoke-all\">Sign out all other sessions</button></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\" style=\"border-color:#dc2626\">\n          <div>\n            <h3 class=\"card-title\">Data &amp; account</h3>\n            <p class=\"card-desc\">Export a copy of your data, or permanently close your account.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"set-row\" style=\"border-top:none\">\n            <div><h4>Download your data</h4><p class=\"small muted\">A ZIP archive with your projects, comments and settings. Ready in ~10 minutes.</p></div>\n            <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\">Request export</button>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"set-row\">\n            <div><h4>Delete account</h4><p class=\"small muted\">Permanently removes your profile, projects and all associated data after a 30-day grace period. <strong>This cannot be undone.</strong></p></div>\n            <button class=\"btn btn-destructive btn-sm\" id=\"delete-btn\">Delete account</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"savebar\">\n          <span class=\"small muted\">Privacy changes apply immediately.</span>\n          <button class=\"btn save-now\">Save preferences</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"toast\">Changes saved</div>\n\n<script>\n  const tabs = document.querySelectorAll('.tab');\n  tabs.forEach(t => t.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    tabs.forEach(x => x.classList.remove('active'));\n    t.classList.add('active');\n    document.querySelectorAll('[role=\"tabpanel\"]').forEach(p => p.hidden = p.id !== 'panel-' + t.dataset.panel);\n  }));\n\n  const toast = document.getElementById('toast');\n  function showToast(msg){\n    toast.textContent = msg;\n    toast.classList.add('show');\n    clearTimeout(showToast._t);\n    showToast._t = setTimeout(() => toast.classList.remove('show'), 2200);\n  }\n\n  document.getElementById('save-profile').addEventListener('click', () => showToast('Profile updated'));\n  document.querySelectorAll('.save-now').forEach(b => b.addEventListener('click', () => showToast('Preferences saved')));\n\n  document.querySelectorAll('.revoke').forEach(b => b.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    b.closest('tr').remove();\n    showToast('Session revoked');\n  }));\n\n  document.getElementById('revoke-all').addEventListener('click', () => {\n    document.querySelectorAll('.revoke').forEach(b => b.closest('tr').remove());\n    showToast('All other sessions signed out');\n  });\n\n  const del = document.getElementById('delete-btn');\n  del.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    if (del.dataset.armed) { showToast('Deletion request received — check your email'); del.textContent = 'Delete account'; delete del.dataset.armed; }\n    else { del.dataset.armed = '1'; del.textContent = 'Are you sure? Click again'; setTimeout(() => { del.textContent = 'Delete account'; delete del.dataset.armed; }, 4000); }\n  });\n</script>\n```","deltas":[[11766,"```html\n<style>\n  .tabs{display:flex;gap:2px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(128,128,128,.25);margin-bottom: